9:2":"vous saurez","11:39:3":"(à) qui","11:39:4":"lui viendra","11:39:5":"un châtiment","11:39:6":"(qui) lui donnera la disgrâce","11:39:7":"et (qui) est dû","11:39:8":"à lui","11:39:9":"un châtiment","11:39:10":"permanent. »","11:40:1":"Jusqu’à ce que,","11:40:2":"quand","11:40:3":"est arrivé","11:40:4":"Notre ordre","11:40:5":"et a débordé (l’eau)","11:40:6":"(du) four à pain,","11:40:7":"Nous avons dit :","11:40:8":"Charge","11:40:9":"en elle","11:40:10":"de","11:40:11":"chaque (espèce)","11:40:12":"un couple","11:40:13":"(de) deux","11:40:14":"et ta famille -","11:40:15":"sauf","11:40:16":"quiconque","11:40:17":"a précédé","11:40:18":"contre lui","11:40:19":"la parole -","11:40:20":"et quiconque","11:40:21":"a accepté la foi. »","11:40:22":"Et n’","11:40:23":"a (pas) cru","11:40:24":"avec lui","11:40:25":"sauf","11:40:26":"peu.","11:41:1":"Et il a dit :","11:41:2":"« Montez","11:41:3":"sur elle,","11:41:4":"avec (Le) Nom","11:41:5":"(d’)Allâh","11:41:6":"(sont) son parcours","11:41:7":"et son encrage.","11:41:8":"Certes,","11:41:9":"mon Maître (est)","11:41:10":"certainement très pardonneur,","11:41:11":"très miséricordieux. »","11:42:1":"Et elle","11:42:2":"naviguait","11:42:3":"avec eux","11:42:4":"sur","11:42:5":"des vagues","11:42:6":"comme les montagnes","11:42:7":"et a appelé","11:42:8":"Noé","11:42:9":"son fils","11:42:10":"alors qu’il était","11:42:11":"dans","11:42:12":"un endroit d’éloignement :","11:42:13":"« Ô mon fiston !","11:42:14":"Monte","11:42:15":"avec nous","11:42:16":"et ne","11:42:17":"sois (pas)","11:42:18":"parmi","11:42:19":"les mécréants ! »","11:43:1":"Il a dit :","11:43:2":"« Je me réfugierai très bientôt","11:43:3":"vers","11:43:4":"une montagne","11:43:5":"(qui) me protégera","11:43:6":"de","11:43:7":"l’eau. »","11:43:8":"Il a dit :","11:43:9":"« (Il n’y a) aucun","11:43:10":"protecteur","11:43:11":"aujourd’hui","11:43:12":"de","11:43:13":"(l’)ordre","11:43:14":"(d’)Allâh","11:43:15":"sauf","11:43:16":"(pour) quiconque","11:43:17":"Il fait miséricorde. »","11:43:18":"Et ont séparé","11:43:19":"entre eux deux","11:43:20":"les vagues,","11:43:21":"il était donc","11:43:22":"parmi","11:43:23":"les noyés.","11:44:1":"Et il a été dit :","11:44:2":"« Ô terre !","11:44:3":"Avale","11:44:4":"ton eau !","11:44:5":"Et ô ciel !","11:44:6":"cesse ! »","11:44:7":"Et est devenue diminuée","11:44:8":"l’eau","11:44:9":"et a été exécuté","11:44:10":"l’affaire","11:44:11":"et elle s’est installé","11:44:12":"sur","11:44:13":"le (mont) Djoudi.","11:44:14":"Et il a été dit :","11:44:15":"« (Que soit éloignés avec) un éloignement","11:44:16":"pour les gens","11:44:17":"injustes ! »","11:45:1":"Et a invoqué","11:45:2":"Noé","11:45:3":"son Maître","11:45:4":"et a dit :","11:45:5":"« Mon Maître !","11:45:6":"Certes,","11:45:7":"mon fils","11:45:8":"(est) de","11:45:9":"ma famille.","11:45:10":"Et certes,","11:45:11":"ta promesse","11:45:12":"(est) la vérité","11:45:13":"et Tu (es)","11:45:14":"(Celui) qui juge le mieux","11:45:15":"(parmi) les juges. »","11:46:1":"Il a dit :","11:46:2":"« Ô Noé !","11:46:3":"Certes, Il","11:46:4":"n’est pas","11:46:5":"de","11:46:6":"tes gens.","11:46:7":"Certes, elle (=ton invocation)","11:46:8":"(est) une action","11:46:9":"non","11:46:10":"vertueuse.","11:46:11":"Donc ne","11:46:12":"M’interroge (pas)","11:46:13":"(au sujet de) ce dont","11:46:14":"n’est pas","11:46:15":"à toi","11:46:16":"de lui","11:46:17":"du savoir.","11:46:18":"Certes, Je","11:46:19":"te conseille de manière émouvante","11:46:20":"de ne pas","11:46:21":"être","11:46:22":"parmi","11:46:23":"les ignorants. »","11:47:1":"Il a dit :","11:47:2":"« Mon Maître !","11:47:3":"Certes, je","11:47:4":"cherche refuge","11:47:5":"auprès (de) Toi","11:47:6":"que","11:47:7":"je Te demande","11:47:8":"(au sujet de) ce dont","11:47:9":"n’est pas","11:47:10":"à moi","11:47:11":"de lui","11:47:12":"du savoir.","11:47:13":"Et si ne pas","11:47:14":"Tu pardonnes","11:47:15":"à moi","11:47:16":"et (si) Tu (ne) me fais (pas) miséricorde,","11:47:17":"je serai","11:47:18":"parmi","11:47:19":"les perdants. »","11:48:1":"Il a été dit :","11:48:2":"« Ô Noé !","11:48:3":"Descends pour t’installer","11:48:4":"avec de la sécurité","11:48:5":"de Nous","11:48:6":"et des bénédictions","11:48:7":"sur toi","11:48:8":"et sur","11:48:9":"des communautés","11:48:10":"de quiconque","11:48:11":"(est) avec toi.","11:48:12":"Et (il y aura) des communautés","11:48:13":"(à qui) Nous leur donnerons très bientôt de la jouissance","11:48:14":"puis","11:48:15":"les touchera","11:48:16":"de Nous","11:48:17":"un châtiment","11:48:18":"douloureux.","11:49:1":"Cela (est)","11:49:2":"parmi","11:49:3":"(les) informations","11:49:4":"(de) l’inaperçu,","11:49:5":"Nous les révélons","11:49:6":"à toi.","11:49:7":"Ne pas","11:49:8":"tu (les) connaissais","11:49:9":"tu les connaissais","11:49:10":"toi","11:49:11":"et pas (non plus)","11:49:12":"ton peuple","11:49:13":"[d’]","11:49:14":"avant","11:49:15":"ceci.","11:49:16":"Endure donc.","11:49:17":"Certes,","11:49:18":"la fin (est)","11:49:19":"pour les pieux.","11:50:1":"Et à","11:50:2":"ʿÂd","11:50:3":"(Nous avons envoyé) leur frère","11:50:4":"Hoûd.","11:50:5":"Il a dit :","11:50:6":"« Ô mon peuple !","11:50:7":"Adorez","11:50:8":"Allâh,","11:50:9":"ne pas","11:50:10":"(il y a) pour vous","11:50:11":"de","11:50:12":"dieu","11:50:13":"autre (que) Lui.","11:50:14":"Ne pas","11:50:15":"vous (êtes)","11:50:16":"sauf","11:50:17":"des inventeurs.","11:51:1":"Ô mon peuple !","11:51:2":"Ne pas","11:51:3":"je vous demande","11:51:4":"pour lui","11:51:5":"(de) compensation.","11:51:6":"N’(est) pas","11:51:7":"(la responsabilité de) ma compensation","11:51:8":"sauf","11:51:9":"à","11:51:10":"Celui qui","11:51:11":"m’a créé et rendu manifeste.","11:51:12":"Donc est-ce que ne pas","11:51:13":"vous raisonnerez ?","11:52:1":"Et ô mon peuple !","11:52:2":"Demandez pardon","11:52:3":"(à) votre Maître","11:52:4":"puis","11:52:5":"repentez-vous","11:52:6":"vers lui,","11:52:7":"Il enverra","11:5